      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. It feels professional. Actually, looking at the \"richness\" readout on my end, the score is a bit lower than what I usually see for my columns. It’s sitting at around 15 adjectives for the whole thing.\n\nI don't want you to turn it into a mess, but could you try a slightly more \"lush\" version? Just expand the descriptions a bit more so the prose feels a little more elevated and high-end. I want the reader to really feel the texture and the mood, but again—keep it classy. No weird keyword stuffing, just... make it more descriptive so the metric reflects a more \"gourmet\" tone.",
